[h2]Build 0.9.135[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]When gear from any mod has no materials listed on the item itself, the mod reads the crafting recipe that makes it (added in 0.9.134). It now only uses a recipe that makes the item from materials, skipping conversion recipes that turn one piece of gear into another (dyeing, re-tailoring, upgrades), so recycling never hands back a different item.
[/list]
